==English==
{{wikipedia|heavy metals}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|sg=[[heavy]] [[metal]]}}

# Any metal that has a [[specific gravity]] greater than about 5, especially one, such as [[lead]], that is [[poisonous]] and may be a [[hazard]] in the [[environment]].
# {{music}} A genre descended from [[rock music]], characterized by massive sound, highly amplified distortion, extended guitar solos, complex song structure, emphatic beats and overall loudness, often with lyrics that involving violent or fantastic imagery.
{{wikipedia|Heavy metal music}}

